## Summary

Fixes plugin load failure caught via `/reload-plugins` + `/doctor`:

```
staged-review@deltahedge [staged-review]: Hook load failed: hooks: expected record, received undefined
```

`plugins/staged-review/hooks/hooks.json` was missing the top-level `"hooks": { ... }` wrapper. Every other plugin in the repo (`elixir`, `cloud-delegation`) wraps event names inside that record. Pre-existing bug from v1.17 — the plugin had no hooks before that, so the schema mismatch was latent until the file was created.

## Fix

```diff
 {
+  "hooks": {
     "SessionStart": [
       {
         "hooks": [
           {
             "type": "command",
             "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/check-unaudited-commits.sh",
             "timeout": 10
           }
         ]
       }
     ]
+  }
 }
```

Patch bump 1.18.0 → 1.18.1.

## Test plan

- [x] `jq .` validates the JSON
- [ ] `/reload-plugins` after merge — staged-review loads cleanly, `/doctor` shows no plugin errors
- [ ] SessionStart hook fires on next session start in a repo with ≥3 unaudited commits
